proof_plan:
By [[Definition:Submultiplicative Norm|submultiplicativity]] of the [[Definition:Operator Norm|operator norm]]:
:$
orm {\dfrac {\mathbf A^k} {k!} } \le \dfrac {
orm {\mathbf A}^k} {k!}$
The scalar series for $e^{
orm {\mathbf A} }$ converges, so the matrix series converges absolutely by the [[Weierstrass M-Test]].
